[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――所信表明演説、当日",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—The day of the platform speech"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "字幕",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Caption"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、続いて生徒会長候補の応援演説と\n所信表明演説を始めます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next, we'll begin the endorsement and platform speeches for the student council president candidates."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "い、いよいよですね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's finally time..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（抽選の結果、私たちの発表順は４人中４人目。\n\u3000聴衆の記憶に残るという意味では悪くない順番だ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(According to the draw, we're speaking last. That's not a bad position in terms of leaving an impression on the audience.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（だが、１つ気になるのは――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(But there's one thing that concerns me—)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（直前の演説者が彼だということ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(And that's the fact that he will speak right before me.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私に、彼を超える演説ができるだろうか？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Will I be able to deliver a speech that surpasses his?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――私は全部活の予算アップを実現し、\n生徒たちの部活ライフを充実させることを約束する！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—I promise to increase the budget for all club activities and enhance the club life of every student!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "候補者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "以上だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's all!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "候補者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Candidate"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとうございました。\nでは、続いての候補者は２年生のロマンさんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you. Next up is second-year student, Roman."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "推薦人の方は壇上にお上がりください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would the endorser please come to the stage?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだ、どうした？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's going on?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何かトラブルか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is there some kind of problem?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの、推薦人の方……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, the endorser..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すまない！\u3000推薦人は急病で来れなくなってしまった。\n候補者の演説のみで構わないだろうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I apologize! My endorser has fallen ill and couldn't make it. Would it be acceptable to proceed with just my speech?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、分かりました……では、お願いします",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I understand... Please go ahead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "た、大変なことになりましたね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh no, this is quite the predicament."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、これでユナが有利になったんじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But doesn't this give Juna an advantage now?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうとも限りませんよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Not necessarily."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どういうこと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you mean?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "演説直前のトラブルで聴衆の注目を集める。\nそういう狙いかもしれません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Drawing the audience's attention with a last-minute issue could be part of his strategy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、最初から推薦人なんていないってことですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you're saying there was never an endorser to begin with?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "真偽は分かりません。ただ、そういう手を使ってきても\nおかしくないということです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't say for certain. I'm simply pointing out that such tactics wouldn't be surprising."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もしそうだとすれば……彼は自分の演説によっぽどの\n自信がある、ということでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If that is the case... he must be extremely confident in his speech."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、候補者の所信表明演説を始めてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please begin your speech."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この度、生徒会長に立候補したロマンだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I am Roman, candidate for student council president."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――生徒諸君。私には夢がある！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Fellow students! I have a dream!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは、この学園に通うすべての生徒が、\n己の夢を実現することだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A dream where every student attending this academy can achieve their own dreams!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このランターナ学園は、長い伝統を持つ名門校だ。\nこれまで、数々の傑物を世に輩出してきた歴史がある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lantarna Academy is a prestigious school with a long tradition. Throughout history, it has produced countless exceptional individuals."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この場にいる皆も、\nそれぞれの夢を胸に学園の門を叩いたことだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone here today must have arrived at this academy's gates with their own dreams in their hearts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "夢とは、人生に活力を与えるものだ。\n道に迷い、挫ける時があっても、己の支えになるものだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Dreams give us nourishment in life. Even when we lose our way or falter, they become our bedrock we can turn to for support."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "夢を持つすべての者が、その夢に向かって全力で\n打ち込めるような学園を作り上げる――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To create an academy where everyone with a dream can pursue it with all their might—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は、そんな浪漫を追いかけたい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That is the ideal I wish to chase!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（――あ、思い出した）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(—Ah, I remember now!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちなみに……お兄さんはどうして馬車を？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way... why did you become a coachman?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "浪漫さ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Romance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "御者",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Coachman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あの時の御者のお兄さん！\n\u3000学園の生徒だったの！？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That coachman from before! He was an academy student?!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そんなことより……みんなロマンさんの演説に\n\u3000呑まれてるみたい……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(More importantly... everyone seems captivated by Roman's speech...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（私だって、錬金術への夢を追って学園に来た一人。\n\u3000ロマンさんの言いたいこと、すごく分かる）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I'm one of those who came to the academy chasing my dream of alchemy. I completely understand what Roman is trying to say.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ユナ先輩……大丈夫かな？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Miss Juna... will she be okay?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]